"The receipts wait on %(receipts)s and the statement line on %(statement)s."
msgstr ""
"Încasările așteaptă pe %(receipts)s, iar linia de extras pe %(statement)s."

#. module: deltatech_expected_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/deltatech_expected_receipt/models/expected_receipt.py:0
